{"text": "From: Walkup, Donna F.\nTo: Montgomery, Nancy W.\nce:\nBCC:\nPrimary Date: 1/30/1998 1:23:53 PM\nLast Modified Date: 1998-Mar-27 10:\nLast Touched Dat\nSent Date: 1998-Jan-30 13:23:53\nReceived Date: 1998-Jan-30 13:23:53\nSubject: Camel Cash Retail Trip{F}\n\nFYI\n\n\u2018Thanks,\n~donna~\n\n---~Original Message=---\nFrom: Gray, Rick\nSent: Friday, January 30, 1998 10:49 AM\nTo: Walkup, Donna F.\nSubject: Camel Cash Retail Trip\n\nDonna -\n\nFirst off, thanks for the sales kits. Second, Martha and I were talking about our trip today,\nand I was throwing out some ideas as to how we should plan it since one of our\ndestinations is so close by. Now that the Bar thing has been thrown in, i's going to\nchange ita litte bit, but try this on for size:\n\nDay 1: We meet at the airport in Greensboro fairly early. We rent a car and drive to\nRaleigh/Chape! Hill. Retail during the day, hitting both cities. Not sure if they have the\nbar program or not, but\nregardless, we would stay the night in Raleigh.\n\nDay 2: Drop off the car in Raleigh and fly to Atlanta, Retail during the day and bar\nprogram at night.\nStay the night in Atlanta,\n\nDay 3: Depending on how late we stay out, fly to Greensborosometime the next morning.\nBack in the o ffice 2nd half of the day.\n\nRJRO000001499050091\n\n70013 3804\n\n9LLb LeLeg", "words": [{"text": "From:", "x0": 114, "y0": 92, "x1": 151, "y1": 104, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Walkup,", "x0": 156, "y0": 92, "x1": 204, "y1": 107, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Donna", "x0": 208, "y0": 93, "x1": 246, "y1": 104, "conf": 86.0}, {"text": "F.", "x0": 250, "y0": 93, "x1": 260, "y1": 104, "conf": 81.0}, {"text": "To:", "x0": 114, "y0": 109, "x1": 134, "y1": 121, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Montgomery,", "x0": 139, "y0": 110, "x1": 216, "y1": 124, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Nancy", "x0": 219, "y0": 110, "x1": 257, "y1": 124, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "W.", "x0": 261, "y0": 110, "x1": 277, "y1": 121, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "ce:", "x0": 114, "y0": 127, "x